    "decisionSummary": "CyberTeller v0.1.99/appVersion-176 is retained only as a forensic source candidate and is release-held. Its source envelope coverage rejects an unauthenticated offline-signer HTTP call, and its only fiat deposit endpoints remain outside the sealed corridor while depending on legacy FINREACT env/secret material that ConfigGate v27 deliberately clears. A later versioned source cut must provide a typed sealed fiat-deposit authority and pass the full gates before it can be selected for release.",
